exports[`Markdown report > hd-dup-index: matches its snapshot (product name replaced, so the name stays only in brand) 1`] = `
"# <productName> check report

Manifest: \`fixtures/manifests/hd-dup-index.json\` · Routes read: 7 · Network checked: eip155:84532

Found from your route manifest, not from a live run.

| Outcome | Count |
|---|---|
